thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NFC</td>\n<td>组合形式（默认推荐）</td>\n<td>存储、比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NFD</td>\n<td>分解形式</td>\n<td>去除重音搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NFKC</td>\n<td>兼容组合</td>\n<td>标识符比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NFKD</td>\n<td>兼容分解</td>\n<td>全文搜索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"intl-segmenter-文本分段\">Intl.Segmenter 文本分段</h2><p>不同语言的文本分段规则差异很大。中日韩文没有空格分词，泰语和缅甸语的词边界也与英语完全不同。Intl.Segmenter 提供了基于 Unicode 标准的文本分段能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const segmentText = (text: string, locale: string, granularity: &#39;grapheme&#39; | &#39;word&#39; | &#39;sentence&#39;): string[] =&gt; {&#10;  const segmenter = new Intl.Segmenter(locale, { granularity });&#10;  return [...segmenter.segment(text)].map((s) =&gt; s.segment);&#10;};&#10;&#10;console.log(segmentText(&#39;Hello World&#39;, &#39;en&#39;, &#39;word&#39;));&#10;console.log(segmentText(&#39;你好世界&#39;, &#39;zh&#39;, &#39;word&#39;));&#10;console.log(segmentText(&#39;こんにちは世界&#39;, &#39;ja&#39;, &#39;word&#39;));&#10;&#10;const truncateByGrapheme = (text: string, maxGraphemes: number, ellipsis = &#39;…&#39;): string =&gt; {&#10;  const segmenter = new Intl.Segmenter(&#39;en&#39;, { granularity: &#39;grapheme&#39; });&#10;  const segments = [...segmenter.segment(text)];&#10;&#10;  if (segments.length &lt;= maxGraphemes) {&#10;    return text;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    segments&#10;      .slice(0, maxGraphemes)&#10;      .map((s) =&gt; s.segment)&#10;      .join(&#39;&#39;) + ellipsis&#10;  );&#10;};&#10;&#10;console.log(truncateByGrapheme(&#39;Hello 🌍 World&#39;, 8));&#10;console.log(truncateByGrapheme(&#39;👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Family&#39;, 3));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> segmentText</span><span style=